[133.786448, "o", "Converged. The mass convention mattered: with exact masses (neutron 1.008665 u, ⁹⁰Zr 89.9047 u) σ_R = 1301.639 mb, matching the KD02 reference anchor (1301.640 mb) to 5+ digits. Let me fix the decks and re-run.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[136.114977, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work && for e in 24 50 55; do /Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/skills/fresco/scripts/run_fresco.sh n90zr_$e.in n90zr_$e 2>/dev/null | grep -i \"REACTION cross section\\|run dir\"; done\r\n# run dir : /var/folders/hv/g3sqr4z92cs_s38_dsphydym0000gn/T//fresco-runs/n90zr_24\r\n0CUMULATIVE REACTION cross section                 = 1620.04314  <L> =     5.31  <L**2> =     32.7\r\n# run dir : /var/folders/hv/g3sqr4z92cs_s38_dsphydym0000gn/T//fresco-runs/n90zr_50\r\n0CUMULATIVE REACTION cross section                 = 1301.63910  <L> =     6.97  <L**2> =     56.4\r\n# run dir : /var/folders/hv/g3sqr4z92cs_s38_dsphydym0000gn/T//fresco-runs/n90zr_55\r\n0CUMULATIVE REACTION cross section                 = 1258.17968  <L> =     7.21  <L**2> =     60.4\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[140.569875, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /var/folders/hv/g3sqr4z92cs_s38_dsphydym0000gn/T/fresco-runs/n90zr_50 && echo \"=== fort.16 head ===\" && head -40 fort.16\r\n=== fort.16 head ===\r\n# 181 angles,  1 tensor ranks for 0=projectile\r\n@subtitle   \"n + 90Zr elastic, KD02 global OMP, E_lab = 50 MeV\"                             \r\n@legend ON\r\n@legend x1 0.2\r\n@legend y1 0.8\r\n@g0 type LOGY\r\n@yaxis ticklabel format power\r\n@xaxis label \"Scattering angle (degrees)\"\r\n@yaxis label \"Cross section (mb/sr)\"\r\n@legend string   0 \"Partition=  1 Excit=  1 near/far= 1\"\r\n#legend string   0 \"Lab energy =   50.0000\"\r\n@s0 linestyle   1\r\n#  Theta       sigma       iT11        T20         T21         T22         Kyy for projectile\r\n  0.1000E-01  0.1531E+05\r\n   1.000      0.1518E+05\r\n   2.000      0.1479E+05\r\n   3.000      0.1416E+05\r\n   4.000      0.1332E+05\r\n   5.000      0.1230E+05\r\n   6.000      0.1115E+05\r\n   7.000       9911.    \r\n   8.000       8633.    \r\n   9.000       7360.    \r\n   10.00       6133.    \r\n   11.00       4988.    \r\n   12.00       3952.    \r"]
