[191.777786, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work && python3 make_plot.py\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work/make_plot.py\", line 36, in <module>\r\n    th50, s50 = read_fresco16(f\"{RUN}/n90zr_50/fort.16\")\r\n                ~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\n  File \"/Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work/make_plot.py\", line 17, in read_fresco16\r\n    th.append(float(c[0]))\r\n              ~~~~~^^^^^^\r\nValueError: could not convert string to float: 'END'\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[194.071902, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit work/make_plot.py\r\nIndex: /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work/make_plot.py\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work/make_plot.py\r\n+++ /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work/make_plot.py\r\n@@ -13,10 +13,12 @@\r\n             s = line.strip()\r\n             if not s or s[0] in \"#@\":\r\n                 continue\r\n             c = s.split()\r\n-            th.append(float(c[0]))\r\n-            sig.append(float(c[1]))\r\n+            try:\r\n+                th.append(float(c[0])); sig.append(float(c[1]))\r\n+            except ValueError:\r\n+                continue\r\n     return np.array(th), np.array(sig)\r\n \r\n def read_exfor(path, lab_is_cm=False):\r\n     th, sig, err = [], [], []\r\n\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[196.218538, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work && python3 make_plot.py\r\nsaved /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work/n90zr_KD02_vs_EXFOR.png\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work/make_plot.py\", line 84, in <module>\r\n    rat = interp / es\r\n                   ^^\r\nNameError: name 'es' is not defined. Did you mean: 'ex'?\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[200.016077, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit work/make_plot.py\r\nIndex: /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work/make_plot.py\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work/make_plot.py\r\n+++ /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work/make_plot.py\r\n@@ -78,8 +78,8 @@\r\n fig.savefig(out, dpi=150, bbox_inches=\"tight\")\r\n print(\"saved\", out)\r\n \r\n # quick numeric sanity: interpolate calc at a few data angles\r\n-for name, ex, thc, sc in [(\"24\", ex24, th24, s24), (\"55\", ex55, th55, s55)]:\r\n+for name, ex, es_, thc, sc in [(\"24\", ex24, es24, th24, s24), (\"55\", ex55, es55, th55, s55)]:\r\n     interp = np.interp(ex, thc, sc)\r\n-    rat = interp / es\r\n+    rat = interp / es_\r\n     print(f\"{name} MeV: calc/data mean={rat.mean():.3f}, rms log10={np.sqrt(np.mean(np.log10(rat)**2)):.3f}\")\r\n\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[202.177022, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work && python3 make_plot.py\r\nsaved /Users/jinlei/fusion-demo/n90zr/work/n90zr_KD02_vs_EXFOR.png\r\n24 MeV: calc/data mean=0.929, rms log10=0.116\r\n55 MeV: calc/data mean=0.995, rms log10=0.045\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[205.029276, "o", "\u001b[0m→ \u001b[0mRead work/n90zr_KD02_vs_EXFOR.png\r\n"]
[221.293469, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n算完了，结论是：**EXFOR 上没有 50 MeV 的 n+⁹⁰Zr 弹性散射数据**，最近的实验是 24 MeV（同位素靶，全角区）和 55 MeV（天然 Zr，前角区），我用这两条做了校验。\r\n\r\n**计算（FRESCO + KD02 全局光学势，n+⁹⁰Zr @ 50 MeV）**\r\n- 反应截面 σ_R = 1301.64 mb，与 KD02 参考值 1301.640 mb 吻合到 5 位（验证过 hcm/rmatch/jtmax 已收敛，且与质量约定无关的 1299 mb 差异来自是否用精确质量：用 n=1.008665、⁹⁰Zr=89.9047 才对齐）。\r\n- 角分布取 `fort.16`（中子无 Rutherford 比，直接是 mb/sr，c.m. 角）。\r\n\r\n**与实验对比**\r\n| 能量 | EXFOR | 靶 | 角区 | calc/data（平均） | 散点 rms log10 |\r\n|------|-------|-----|------|------------------|----------------|\r\n| 24 MeV | 13160.004 | ⁹⁰Zr 97.7% | 15–160° | 0.93 | 0.116 |\r\n| 55 MeV | 22480.005 | 天然 Zr | 2.6–53.5°（lab≈c.m.） | 1.00 | 0.045 |\r\n\r\n55 MeV 前角区吻合极好（~11% 散点，符合全局势精度）；24 MeV"]
[221.293476, "o", " 的 ~30% 散点是衍射极小处对势敏感的正常水平。\r\n\r\n图存于 `work/n90zr_KD02_vs_EXFOR.png`（三幅面板：50 MeV 计算、24 MeV 校验、55 MeV 校验）。注意 55 MeV 数据是 lab 系且天然 Zr 靶，我用 ⁹⁰Zr 近似、lab≈c.m.（<2% 偏差，远小于实验误差），已在图注标明。"]
[221.293507, "o", "\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[221.326561, "x", "0"]
